    "updated_at": "2022-11-24T06:25:36Z",
    "body": "I think the progress & meter should fill up in the inline flow direction for consistency with horizontal mode and how webpage flow works generally, so:\r\n* `writing-mode: vertical-*` & `direction: ltr`: Top to bottom\r\n* `writing-mode: vertical-*` & `direction: rtl`: Bottom to Top\r\n* `writing-mode: sideways-*` & `direction: ltr`: Bottom to Top\r\n* `writing-mode: sideways-*` & `direction: rtl`: Top to Bottom",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
