    "created_at": "2022-11-30T10:45:41Z",
    "updated_at": "2022-11-30T10:45:41Z",
    "body": "We have been getting feedback from the expert communities, as follows.\r\n\r\nThere appears to be consensus that horizontally inline controls should grow in the reading direction – ie. left to right for english, right to left for arabic, hebrew, etc. https://github.com/w3c/hlreq/issues/32  https://github.com/w3c/alreq/issues/259\r\n\r\nFor vertical text we have an interesting situation:\r\nJapanese folks prefer the control to grow from bottom to top. https://github.com/w3c/jlreq/issues/342\r\nChinese folks prefer it to grow from top to bottom. https://github.com/w3c/clreq/issues/500\r\n",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
    "reactions": {
      "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/whatwg/html/issues/comments/1331958561/reactions",
      "total_count": 0,
