    "updated_at": "2024-01-03T21:52:25Z",
    "body": "An update on the blink implementation (will ship soon): We are following what is suggested above by nt1m.\r\nFor `<meter>`, `<progress>`, `<input type=range>`, if `direction: ltr`, value is rendered top to bottom. If `direction: rtl`, value is rendered bottom to top.\r\n",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
